IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dua-insignia`

-- Decorations and Uniforms Act 1922, ss 2, 3 and 4 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_decorations-and-uniforms-act-1922.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `ss 2(1), 3(1) and 4 -- wearing or using`

