#ASSERT `wearing or using the item is an offence` `a military uniform` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `wearing or using the item is an offence` `part of a police uniform` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `wearing or using the item is an offence` `a lookalike military uniform calculated to deceive` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `wearing or using the item is an offence` `a lookalike military medal calculated to deceive` FALSE FALSE
