§ `ss 2(2)(a), 3(2)(a) -- false representation`

#ASSERT `the false representation is an offence` `a Presidential decoration` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the false representation is an offence` `a Presidential decoration` TRUE TRUE
