§ `s 2(1) -- titles of rank and letters`

#ASSERT `assuming the title is an offence` `a military rank such as Colonel` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `assuming the title is an offence` `a military rank such as Colonel` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `assuming the title is an offence` `a police rank such as Inspector` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `assuming the title is an offence` `post-nominal letters of a Presidential decoration` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `assuming the title is an offence` `post-nominal letters of a university degree` FALSE FALSE
