§ `ss 2 and 3 -- penalty`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `wearing a protected item` EQUALS 400
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `supplying a foreign item` EQUALS 400

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `falsely claiming entitlement` EQUALS 3

#ASSERT `the sentence is within the limits` `wearing a protected item` 400 0
#ASSERT `the sentence is within the limits` `wearing a foreign item` 0 3
#ASSERT NOT `the sentence is within the limits` `wearing a protected item` 401 0
#ASSERT NOT `the sentence is within the limits` `assuming a title or letters` 0 4
